description: "Research upgrades for your buildings and unlock them in-game.\n\nHow to use:\n1. Pause the game and open New Tech's.\n2. Pick a category and a block.\n3. Research upgrades, then install them on your buildings.\n\nContracts, specialization, ally gifts, shop and missions included."
